        <mxCell id="notes" value="&lt;b&gt;Attendance and settlement&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr&gt;CheckedOutUtc records actual departure.&lt;br&gt;With settlement enforcement enabled, departure releases the bays.&lt;br&gt;Awaiting settlement precedes authorized final checkout.&lt;br&gt;CheckoutCompletedUtc records final completion.&lt;br&gt;Booking-stage deposit fields remain separate." vertex="1" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=12;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=14;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#333333;">
